<li>Snow removal equipment.</li>
<li>Domestic power equipment (e.g., lawnmowers) when operated during standard daytime hours (7:00 AM – 7:00 PM weekdays; 9:00 AM – 7:00 PM weekends/holidays).</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Enforcement and Penalties</strong></h3>
