why did glen beck leave fox</p>
<p><strong>Search&#39;s response:</strong><br>
Glenn Beck&#39;s departure from Fox News in June 2011 was officially described as a &quot;mutual agreement&quot; to transition off his daily show, but it was driven by several underlying business and personal factors:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Advertiser Boycotts:</strong> More than 400 companies <a href="https://www.jacksonville.com/story/entertainment/local/2011/04/06/glenn-beck-leaving-his-fox-news-channel-show/15908417007/">pulled their ads</a> from his show following highly controversial remarks, including his 2009 claim that President Barack Obama had a <a href="https://www.nbcdfw.com/news/national-international/glenn-beck-signs-off-fox-news-show/1856853/">&quot;deep-seated hatred for white people&quot;</a>. This made it increasingly difficult for Fox to monetize his high ratings.</li>
<li><strong>Declining Ratings:</strong> While his viewership remained high for the 5:00 PM slot, it had <a href="https://www.reuters.com/article/lifestyle/glenn-beck-and-fox-news-end-daily-tv-show-idUSTRE7357PL/">dropped by roughly 30%</a> (nearly one million viewers) from its 2010 peak, signaling that his influence might be waning.</li>
<li><strong>Building His Own Media Empire:</strong> Beck was eager to move &quot;outside the system&quot; and launched his own digital subscription service, <strong><a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/01/business/media/01fox.html">GBTV</a></strong> (which later became <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TheBlaze">TheBlaze</a>). During his final broadcast, he stated he was &quot;running to something&quot; and that his show had become a <a href="https://www.nbcdfw.com/news/national-international/glenn-beck-signs-off-fox-news-show/1856853/">movement that &quot;doesn&#39;t belong on television anymore&quot;</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Health and Personal Reasons:</strong> Years later, Beck revealed he had been suffering from a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glenn_Beck">severe neurological disorder</a> and an autoimmune issue during his time at Fox, which he said had &quot;made [him] feel crazy&quot; and <a href="https://www.tvinsider.com/1240910/why-did-glenn-beck-leave-fox-news-exit-reason-today-updates/">impacted his work</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Internal Tension:</strong> There were reports of <a href="https://www.businessinsider.com/glenn-beck-fox-news-fired-ratings-2011-4">friction with Fox News management</a>, who reportedly felt his focus on his independent business ventures and increasingly conspiratorial tone were <a href="https://www.latimes.com/entertainment/la-xpm-2011-apr-07-la-et-glenn-beck-20110407-story.html">damaging the network&#39;s brand</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>Following his exit, the 5:00 PM slot was filled by the ensemble roundtable show <strong><a href="https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/tv/tv-news/five-replaces-glenn-beck-fox-news-243635/"><em>The Five</em></a></strong>.</p>
