<li><strong>Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Engineer:</strong> Focuses on connecting LLMs to an organization&#39;s specific, trusted data sources. This specialization is critical for reducing &quot;hallucinations&quot; and improving the reliability of enterprise AI.</li>
